      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Tears of the gluteus medius tendon contribute to greater trochanteric pain syndrome, but they are often overlooked as a cause of lateral hip pain and tenderness. This review presents the relevant anatomy, pathophysiology, diagnostic workup, differential diagnosis and management of these tears."},
